### Status
GET {{url}}/api/status/stats

### Version
GET {{url}}/api/status/version

### Oauth
GET {{url}}/api/status/oauth/info

### Oauth - id token
POST {{oauthUrl}}/api/oauth/id-tokens/from-login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "login": "{{login}}",
    "password": "{{password}}",
    "targetAudience": "Okarina"
}

